	// PERKS — the WIRED list only (honesty rule, brief §5). The old 10-row
	// shrine + GetPerkList are CUT: LV 20 (Beast Trainer) is unwired, LV 25 +
	// LV 45 are raid-gated, LV 40 + LV 50 are copy-only cosmetics — none may
